https://github.com/machinemirror/morocco-census

Underlying statistics are produced by the Haut-Commissariat au Plan (HCP), Royaume du Maroc,
Recensement Général de la Population et de l'Habitat 2004, 2014 and 2024; cite HCP as the
original source. Raw HCP files are not redistributed here; data/raw/manifest.json lists
their URLs and checksums and `mc fetch` downloads them.

Third-party inputs:
- Commune seed points are derived from GADM 4.1 (https://gadm.org) level-4 polygons; GADM
  data themselves are not redistributed.
- Seed points for communes GADM lacks come from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), CC BY 4.0.
- The national outline is Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com), public domain.
